d","quoted_text":"[selected-result] Exact two-sided sign test (binomial test, null probability 0.5) on 24 independent proglacial catchments, one paired June-to-September change each: 18 of 24 streams had higher September dissolved organic carbon, proportion 0.750, p = 0.0227, so the 50/50 null is rejected at the 0.05 level.","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":166,"start_line":49},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":3,"end_line":5,"locator":"results/report.md:5-5","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"24 proglacial streams draining separate glaciated headwater catchments were each sampled once in June and once in September of the same melt year. No catchment appears twice in the file and no stream drains into another.","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":1,"start_line":5},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":38,"end_line":44,"locator":"results/report.md:44-44","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"- streams with lower September DOC: 6","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":37,"start_line":44},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":40,"end_line":43,"locator":"results/report.md:43-43","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"- streams with higher September DOC: 18","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":38,"start_line":43},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":42,"end_line":46,"locator":"results/report.md:46-46","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"- proportion of streams increasing: 0.750","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":37,"start_line":46}]}},"importance":"important","interpretive_consequence":"The unresolved premise cannot support an incompatibility or Finding.","non_accusatory":true,"provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"software:sc-referee-controller","actor_kind":"controller","display_name":"sc-referee controller"},"created_at":"2026-08-15T13:27:39Z","method":"deterministic_analysis_posthoc_method_ledger_projection_v1","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"disclosure","schema_version":"0.19.0","source_refs":[{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":168,"end_line":49,"locator":"results/report.md:49-49","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"[selected-result] Exact two-sided sign test (binomial test, null probability 0.5) on 24 independent proglacial catchments, one paired June-to-September change each: 18 of 24 streams had higher September dissolved organic carbon, proportion 0.750, p = 0.0227, so the 50/50 null is rejected at the 0.05 level.","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":166,"start_line":49},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":3,"end_line":5,"locator":"results/report.md:5-5","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"24 proglacial streams draining separate glaciated headwater catchments were each sampled once in June and once in September of the same melt year. No catchment appears twice in the file and no stream drains into another.","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":1,"start_line":5},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":38,"end_line":44,"locator":"results/report.md:44-44","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"- streams with lower September DOC: 6","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":37,"start_line":44},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de587916638733c","end_column":40,"end_line":43,"locator":"results/report.md:43-43","path":"results/report.md","quoted_text":"- streams with higher September DOC: 18","source_kind":"file_span","start_column":38,"start_line":43},{"content_digest":"sha256:10ae1182bf74307049e15ef7c5ee0566023da6f7a300cc3d1de5